message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "FractureFlow: label-free structural-orientation statistics and honest machine-learning benchmarks for fracture data"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-08-29
license: MIT
# PLACEHOLDER: fill in the real author names, ORCID iDs and affiliation
