repository-code: "https://github.com/[ACCOUNT]/fractureflow"
abstract: >-
  FractureFlow turns raw fracture observations (borehole logs, borehole-image
  logs, outcrop trace maps, dense point clouds) into structural-orientation
  statistics (set tables, rose diagrams, DFN screening) without requiring
  fracture-level ground-truth labels, and ships an honest evaluation harness
  with published negative results and information-ceiling measurements.
keywords:
  - fracture networks
  - structural geology
  - borehole image logs
  - discrete fracture network
  - label-free learning
